name: Direct model work requires an allowance while deterministic context remains available
size: 120x36
require-env: KUZUSHI_DEVEX_TARGET
cwd: @TARGET
env-unset: NODE_OPTIONS KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL NO_COLOR
env: HOME=/private/tmp/kuzushi-live-owned-investigation-20261010/home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/unbound_model_allowance.py @TARGET @ART seed
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/unbound-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 approved investigation allowance | unbound-refusal
expect: blocked before execution
expect: run receipt · blocked
expect: Prepare and approve
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/unbound_model_allowance.py @TARGET @ART refused
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 25 approved investigation allowance | refusal-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 25 approved investigation allowance | refusal-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 25 approved investigation allowance | refusal-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 25 approved investigation allowance | refusal-60x20
resize: 40x12
live-snap: refusal-40x12
nav-mode:
keys: z
require-live-snap: 20 READ TRANSCRIPT | refusal-reader-40x12
keys: End PPage PPage
live-snap: refusal-page-40x12
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 20 request started | refusal-guidance-40x12
expect: no model
expect: Prepare and
expect: approve the investigation plan
ask: Does direct model work refuse before any request, preserve existing context and explain that an approved investigation allowance is required?
resize: 120x36
keys: q
submit: logs
paste-file: @ART/deterministic-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 context:build indexed 4 files | deterministic-context
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/unbound_model_allowance.py @TARGET @ART deterministic
submit: open F-0001
require-live-snap: 25 Owned public documentation example | human-decision
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 committed / 6 calls | settled-report
expect: protected review remaining
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=/private/tmp/kuzushi-live-owned-investigation-20261010/home KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 committed / 6 calls | recovered-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/unbound_model_allowance.py @TARGET @ART restarted
ask: Does no-color restart retain the settled request count, human decision and source revision without treating the refusal or deterministic context as new model work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
